  message: "Fixed in PR #2354 (dev 39bef1108) for the two named cases; the doc-name layout question the item puts to the owner is NOT decided here.\nFILED REPROS RE-RUN on dev 39bef1108 (the item's own idfive layout fixtures): Elixir \"defmodule Foo.Bar\" against \"defmodule Foo . Bar\": the module's stable id was ef600f230326857c against f8a69f2d4a2002f2 on dev 05ed6f5fe, and is ef600f230326857c for both on 39bef1108. Vue v-if=\"tab === 'a'\" against the spaced spelling: Item:v-if DIFFERENT on 05ed6f5fe, SAME on 39bef1108, as is Other:v-bind:val.\nITEM CORRECTION (builder): koel's 13 directive names holding a newline came from Vue 3.4 valueless shorthand (:album) read as one node; such attributes are now read one by one (koel: 26 merged directives gone, 64 new; 291 of 2,353 directive ids moved). PHP \"#\" comments inside a type no longer change the id.\nSTILL OPEN, filed: whether a doc symbol's NAME is meant to be layout-free (a Svelte block's own name keeps its layout), and the item's \"also not checked\" list (\"//\" comment ending a hashed text, \"|\" before \"{\"): WI-siror-bupaz-zofiz-jomam-jimim-komoh-vavad-sirar.\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/closure/ (out_dev.txt = dev 39bef1108 after the merge, out_base.txt = dev 05ed6f5fe before it; repro trees t/, run.sh, q.py, presplit.py)."  # 8eb8
